        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabika buumi bwakwe mujanza lyakwe, wakazunda ba-Filisti, aboobo Jehova wakacitila Israyeli luvuno lupati, ayebo wakalibonena cakukondwa, Lino nkaambonzi noti bisizye muntu uutajisi mulandu? Nkaambonzi noti mujaye buyo Davida? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo naakamvwa ijwi eli lya-Jonatani, wakakonkezya kuti, Ncobeni mbuli Jehova mbali-wo, takoofwa pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Jonatani wakaita Davida, wakamulwiida aya makani oonse, mpawo Jonatani wakaleta Davida kuli-Saulo, nkabela wakakala kulinguwe mbubonya mbwaakakede ciindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
