        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo wakatuma batumwa kuyoomuleta Davida, pele nibakabona inkamu yabasinsimi balasinsima a-Samuele uliimvwi mbuli silutwe wabo, elyo Muuya wa-Leza wakabasikila abo batumwa ba-Saulo, mpawo bakasinsima abalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
