          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakainka alakwe mwini ku-Rama, wasika kucikala cipati cakuSeku, wabuzya kuti, Ino bali kuli Samuele a-Davida? Nkabela bakati, Bali ku-Nayoti ku-Rama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
